# StygNox agent skill policy

Treat `AGENTS.md` as the authoritative repository instructions.

Before specialised work:
- read `docs/agent-skills.md` and `docs/agent-skill-routing.md`;
- choose the smallest relevant set of project-local skills from `.agents/skills/`;
- read each relevant `SKILL.md` before applying it.

Skills provide methodology, not additional scope or authority. Do not let skill guidance override the active work order, human gates, controller authority, test restrictions, or evidence-first workflow.

Before claiming work is complete, fixed, passing, or ready, apply `.agents/skills/verification-before-completion/SKILL.md` and verify the actual result.
